            "kicker": "FROM BILLET TO BLANK",
            "heading": "BILLET.",
            "number": "1",
            "text": "<p>Every Fortune Forged wheel begins with certified aerospace-grade 6061-T6 aluminum billet—selected for its exceptional strength-to-weight ratio, structural integrity, and superior finishing characteristics. Engineering starts with material selection, and every step that follows depends on getting that foundation right.</p>",
