            "kicker": "DENSE GRAIN STRUCTURE",
            "heading": "FORGING.",
            "number": "2",
            "text": "<p>The heated 6061-T6 billet is forged under thousands of tons of pressure, compressing and aligning the aluminum's grain structure into a dense, directional grain flow. This process dramatically increases strength, fatigue resistance, and structural integrity, creating a forged blank that can be machined for maximum performance without compromising durability.</p>",
