          "settings": {
            "kicker": "WHERE DESIGN COMES TO LIFE",
            "heading": "MILLING.",
            "number": "3",
            "text": "<p>Multi-axis CNC work sculpts the final design, spoke profile, and mounting geometry to exacting tolerances for fitment, balance, and brake clearance.</p><p>After machining, hand finishing stages — filing, deburring, and surface prep — bring every edge and face to a clean, consistent standard before coating.</p>",
